WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.305
Meet Torren Stonehand.
Level 5 Goliath cleric · 5e 2024 · A separate demo workspace.

2
00:00:03.305 --> 00:00:08.974
A hit lands at the bridge: 8 damage.
Dice and damage are resolved at the table. Rivet keeps the sheet up to date.

3
00:00:08.974 --> 00:00:15.791
Torren answers with Guiding Bolt.
Check the spell in the local SRD. No online connection is needed.

4
00:00:15.791 --> 00:00:20.734
One spell, one 1st-level slot.
Resolve the attack at the table, then record the slot used.

5
00:00:20.734 --> 00:00:27.717
After the fight, recover 6 hit points.
Enter healing already resolved at the table.

6
00:00:27.717 --> 00:00:38.872
Keep the part worth remembering.
The encounter becomes a note in the campaign journal.

7
00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:43.628
Ready for the next turn.
Character changes and campaign notes are saved locally.
